# Backend env — the minimal FastAPI relay (chat, food-photo, file-summary).
# The backend stores NO LLM keys — the browser sends them per request. Its only
# secrets are the Supabase URL + anon key. Never commit the filled-in .env.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_KEY=          # the anon key (requests are RLS-scoped via the user's JWT)
# Optional:
FRONTEND_ORIGIN=*      # set to your frontend origin in production (CORS)
